{"id":114,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":3,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"彼女たちがあの非常識な力を使うたびに、何か悍ましい力が燃えるかのように、手の枷が脈打つ。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"視界がぼやけ、意識がまたあの夢に戻る——\n夢の中の「あなた」は誰かに向けて囁いている……","style":3,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"おいで、ヘカテー、これは終わりじゃない。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108003","vo_cgplot_108003f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":2,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"約束だ……","voice":["vo_cgplot_108004","vo_cgplot_108004f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":2,"background":54,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"短い沈黙の後で、誰かが手を伸ばしてくれた。激しい感情に駆られて、誰かがあなたに近づこうとする。","style":3,"background":55,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"その手を掴もうとした時、粉々に砕けた夢から目覚めてくる……","style":3,"background":55,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"S-019","content":"終わった。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"S-019","content":"局長、怪我は？","voice":["vo_cgplot_108007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"頭を横に振ったが、意識がまだぼんやりしている。先程のことが本当にあったことかどうか分からない、あれは自分が失った記憶なのか？","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"選択肢","content":"昔、会ったことがあるか？","options":["昔、会ったことがあるか？"],"jump":[13],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"S-019","content":"ない。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"選択肢","content":"でも、あなたの名前を知ってる。","options":["でも、あなたの名前を知ってる"],"jump":[15],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"S-019なんかじゃない……あなたの名前は<color=#fb9259>ヘカテー</color>だ。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"S-019","content":"……もうその名前はいらない。","voice":["vo_cgplot_108013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"S-019","content":"でも局長がそう呼びたいなら、それでいい。","voice":["vo_cgplot_10801